epth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Hi Karl,"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Thanks a lot for the report and I think I understand the issue. We are not\nhandling the case of folio migration causing folio having objcg different\ndifferent from its node which breaks the assumption memcg_reparent_objcgs() have\nfor its locking lru of child and parent per-node LRUs."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Thanks for the reproducer and I was able to reproduce with inceased workers. I\nwill send out the fixes soon."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"thanks,\nShakeel"}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":2,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"anMmd1ADrDVwMO6v@work"}},"rootIds":["20260805093522.e3ba46aca3a143207d68a65e@linux-foundation.org","anOHDekdEne06P97@linux.dev"],"childrenByParent":{"20260805093522.e3ba46aca3a143207d68a65e@linux-foundation.org":["anNxSMBgNeLytWOu@linux.dev"]},"chronologicalIds":["20260805093522.e3ba46aca3a143207d68a65e@linux-foundation.org","anNxSMBgNeLytWOu@linux.dev","anOHDekdEne06P97@linux.dev"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{}}}